<title>HONG KONG: Elec &amp; Eltek interim net up 106.06 pct.</title>
<headline>Elec &amp; Eltek interim net up 106.06 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.54	 vs 9.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0	   vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  106.53 gain vs 8.80 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    194.50	vs 94.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     878.38	vs 930.74</p>
<p>    Company name		 Elec &amp; Eltek International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 17-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Elec &amp; Eltek is an electronics maker.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from disposal of 11 million shares in Elec &amp; Eltek International Co Ltd under a placing agreement dated October 18, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
